WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.357 --> 00:00:04.593
&gt;&gt; Bret: JOHN ROBERTS LIVE IN

00:00:04.594 --> 00:00:04.893
PARIS.

00:00:04.894 --> 00:00:08.130
OLD ACCUSATIONS IN A NEW FORM TO

00:00:08.131 --> 00:00:08.864
LABOR "THE WALL STREET JOURNAL"

00:00:08.865 --> 00:00:11.033
REPORTING ON WHAT IT SAYS WAS

00:00:11.034 --> 00:00:12.601
PRESIDENT TRUMP'S DIRECT

00:00:12.602 --> 00:00:14.770
INVOLVEMENT ON THE HUSH MONEY

00:00:14.771 --> 00:00:21.643
PAYOFFS WOMEN ALLEGING SEXUAL

00:00:21.644 --> 00:00:23.311
INVOLVEMENT, WHICH COULD BE

00:00:23.312 --> 00:00:23.945
ILLEGAL.

00:00:23.946 --> 00:00:25.981
&gt;&gt; GOOD EVENING, BRET.

00:00:25.982 --> 00:00:27.516
THE PRESIDENT VIOLATED CAMPAIGN

00:00:27.517 --> 00:00:30.118
FINANCE LAWS, THAT ACCORDING TO

00:00:30.119 --> 00:00:30.752
"THE WALL STREET JOURNAL."

00:00:30.753 --> 00:00:32.621
A VERY INTERESTING STORY, A BIT

00:00:32.622 --> 00:00:33.388
OF A BLOCKBUSTER COMING OUT THIS

00:00:33.389 --> 00:00:34.556
EVENING.

00:00:34.557 --> 00:00:35.857
LET ME SHARE JUST A BIT WHAT

00:00:35.858 --> 00:00:36.525
"THE WALL STREET JOURNAL" IS

00:00:36.526 --> 00:00:38.493
SAYING THIS EVENING AND THAT

00:00:38.494 --> 00:00:38.927
REPORT.

00:00:38.928 --> 00:00:40.128
IT'S A LENGTHY REPORT.

00:00:40.129 --> 00:00:42.631
IT SAYS, AMONGST OTHER THINGS,

00:00:42.632 --> 00:00:45.133
IT'S REFUTING THE PRESIDENT, IS

00:00:45.134 --> 00:00:47.135
LEGAL TEAM, ADVISORS, ALL DENIED

00:00:47.136 --> 00:00:47.936
THAT THE PRESIDENT HAD ANY

00:00:47.937 --> 00:00:50.272
INVOLVEMENT IN HUSH MONEY

00:00:50.273 --> 00:00:50.972
PAYOFFS OF FORMER ADULT FILM

00:00:50.973 --> 00:00:53.308
PERFORMER STORMY DANIELS AND

00:00:53.309 --> 00:00:55.510
ANOTHER WOMAN DURING THE 26 TEAM

00:00:55.511 --> 00:00:55.877
CAMPAIGN.

00:00:55.878 --> 00:01:00.549
THROUGH ITS INVESTIGATION, THIS

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:01.349
NOW RAISES THE POSSIBILITY THAT

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:05.587
THE PRESIDENT VIOLATED FINANCE

00:01:05.588 --> 00:01:07.722
LAWS BECAUSE IT CLAIMS MR. TRUMP

00:01:07.723 --> 00:01:09.491
WAS INVOLVED IN OR BRIEFED ON

00:01:09.492 --> 00:01:10.358
EVERY STEP OF THE HUSH MONEY

00:01:10.359 --> 00:01:12.694
ARRANGEMENTS AND THE AGREEMENTS

00:01:12.695 --> 00:01:14.529
THERE, ALLEGING HE ENGAGED IN OR

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:16.431
DIRECTED THE DEALS BY TELEPHONE

00:01:16.432 --> 00:01:17.966
AND/OR IN MEETINGS WITH HIS

00:01:17.967 --> 00:01:20.869
SELF-DESCRIBED FIXER MICHAEL

00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:21.169
COHEN.

00:01:21.170 --> 00:01:23.305
THIS COMES BY WAY OF EVIDENCE

00:01:23.306 --> 00:01:24.139
GATHERED BY THE SOUTHERN

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:24.706
DISTRICT OF NEW YORK.

00:01:24.707 --> 00:01:27.676
THE U.S. ATTORNEY'S OFFICE IN

00:01:27.677 --> 00:01:31.079
MIAMI USING RECORDINGS MADE BY

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:32.180
MR. COHEN.

00:01:32.181 --> 00:01:35.083
THEY ACTUALLY EXTRACTED A GUILTY

00:01:35.084 --> 00:01:36.118
PLEA FROM MR. COHEN, THE

00:01:36.119 --> 00:01:38.386
PRESIDENT'S FORMER FIXER BACK IN

00:01:38.387 --> 00:01:39.287
AUGUST.

00:01:39.288 --> 00:01:40.021
THEY CONVICTED HIM OF CAMPAIGN

00:01:40.022 --> 00:01:43.725
FINANCE LAW VIOLATIONS,

00:01:43.726 --> 00:01:45.393
CONVERSATIONS OR MEETINGS WITH

00:01:45.394 --> 00:01:47.529
ONE OR MORE MEMBERS OF THE TRUMP

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:48.530
CAMPAIGN TEAM.

00:01:48.531 --> 00:01:50.298
ONE PERSON ACCORDING TO THE

00:01:50.299 --> 00:01:51.933
REPORT, OR AT LEAST IT WAS

00:01:51.934 --> 00:01:52.634
SUGGESTED, THAT PERSON WAS THE

00:01:52.635 --> 00:01:55.537
PRESIDENT HIMSELF.

00:01:55.538 --> 00:01:56.605
ASIDE FROM THE PRESIDENT'S

00:01:56.606 --> 00:01:57.606
DENIALS, WE KNOW THE WHITE HOUSE

00:01:57.607 --> 00:01:59.374
HAS OFFERED A SERIES OF THE

00:01:59.375 --> 00:02:00.108
NAILS ABOUT HIS INVOLVEMENT IN

00:02:00.109 --> 00:02:03.545
THE CIRCUMSTANCE.

00:02:03.546 --> 00:02:05.881
YOU REMEMBER EARLY IN THE YEAR,

00:02:05.882 --> 00:02:06.548
WHITE HOUSE PRESS SECRETARY

00:02:06.549 --> 00:02:08.717
SARAH SANDERS SAID NONE OF THESE

00:02:08.718 --> 00:02:09.284
ALLEGATIONS ARE TRUE.

00:02:09.285 --> 00:02:12.287
BACK IN MAY, WE HEARD RUDY

00:02:12.288 --> 00:02:14.289
GIULIANI DESCRIBE THE PAYMENTS

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:16.691
TO DANIELS, WELL, THE PRESIDENT

00:02:16.692 --> 00:02:17.125
PAID HIM BACK.

00:02:17.126 --> 00:02:19.294
NO CRIME OF ANY KIND.

00:02:19.295 --> 00:02:26.101
MICHAEL, THAT IS COHEN, HAD

00:02:26.102 --> 00:02:27.936
DISCRETION TO SOLVE THESE

00:02:27.937 --> 00:02:28.303
PROBLEMS.

00:02:28.304 --> 00:02:30.373
WE HEARD JAY SEKULOW WOODFIELD

00:02:32.675 --> 00:02:33.442
QUESTIONS ABOUT THE CIRCUMSTANCE

00:02:33.443 --> 00:02:36.412
BUT WE HAVE NOT HEARD FROM HIM

